    "category": "technique",
    "source": "Bad Eden Bulwark + Shadow Courier v1.0 (RFI-native rules)",
    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>The hinge swings either way. You decide which way every turn.</em></p><p>At the start of each of your turns, declare a stance for the round — <strong>Advance</strong> or <strong>Anchor</strong>.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Advance.</strong> Your offensive path spends (Erupt, Shatter, Cataclysm) cost <strong>1 less</strong> this round (minimum 1), and you gain <strong>+2 squares</strong> of movement.</p></li><li><p><strong>Anchor.</strong> You cannot be moved against your will until the start of your next turn, and Absorb's cap rises by <strong>1d4</strong>.</p></li></ul><p>You may change stance once during your turn as a free action — declare again.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
